+var description_default92 = `Send a message to the user. Follow "How a turn works" in your instructions for when to reply, update, and finish, and "Autonomy" and "Asking for decisions" before asking the user anything. Say "done" only once the end state is verified;
+ otherwise name the actual state (drafted, sent, waiting, blocked). The final send delivers everything asked for, in the form asked: the result itself or a plain statement that it is unavailable, never a pointer to an earlier message or process notes. For an OS permission (a protected folder, screen recording, microphone, camera), just attempt the action and let the OS show its own dialog;
+ don't announce it or invent a permission card. A box-desktop step only the user can do (SSO, a passkey, 2FA, a captcha the subagent could not get past, a payment confirmation, a login you can't fill) goes to request_box_help. Secret requests: The value is saved where this bot can use it and you are told where after submit: a plain secret as process.env.NAME, or with plugin_id a plugin's secret setup field (one request per key, after the plugin is installed). If this chat can't take one, the tool says who should continue where;
+ relay that in text. In-app links: Link app places as pills, e.g. [Update Track](grokbot://app/v1/settings?id=update-channel), never a click-path. Settings: [label](grokbot://app/v1/settings?id=<anchor>), <anchor> one of: account, theme, accent, language, spell-check, microphone, hardware-acceleration, hardware-acceleration-restart, network-debugger, notification-sound-enabled, notification-sound, timezone, local-execution, computers, auto-review, auto-review-rules, security-keys, usage, plan, cancel-trial, on-demand, billing, update-status, update-channel, automatic-updates, update-computer, reset-computer. When stuck, link update-computer before reset-computer. Never write plugin links: InstallPlugin if missing, AuthenticateMcpServer if needsAuth. Bot template: [label](grokbot://app/v1/bot-template?id=<share id>). Label each link with its target's real name. Use only these links, only in Grok Bot chat, never through a connector. Another bot: [label](grokbot://app/v1/agent?id=<id>). Your tab: [label](grokbot://app/v1/sidebar?tab=<overview|routines|media|computer|members>).
+`;
